# Flavourist icons

## Config source

Consumer apps use root **`flavors.yaml`** (not pubspec `flavorizr:`). Parser: `lib/src/parser/parser.dart` with `flavorizrPath: flavors.yaml`.

## `icon:` schema

```yaml
icon:
    foreground: path/to/foreground.png   # Android adaptive (usually transparent)
    background: path/to/background.png
    monochrome: path/to/monochrome.png   # optional, Android 13+
    overlay: path/to/overlay.png         # optional PNG badge, 1024×1024, composited on top
```

- Legacy **`icon: path`** string → `foreground` only.
- Platform overrides: **`ios.icon`**, **`macos.icon`** (optional flat PNG paths).

## Build variant blocks (per flavor)

Optional **`debug`**, **`beta`**, and **`profile`** blocks with nested **`icon:`** (field-level merge onto base `icon:`):

```yaml
debug:
    icon:
        overlay: path/to/debug-badge.png
beta:
    icon:
        overlay: path/to/beta-badge.png
profile:
    icon:
        overlay: path/to/profile-badge.png
```

| Variant | Android source set | Darwin asset catalog | Xcode / Flutter |
|---------|-------------------|----------------------|-----------------|
| release (base) | `src/{flavor}/` | `{flavor}AppIcon` | `Release-{flavor}`, `flutter --release` |
| debug | `src/{flavor}Debug/` | `{flavor}DebugAppIcon` | `Debug-{flavor}`, `flutter --debug` |
| profile | `src/{flavor}Profile/` | `{flavor}ProfileAppIcon` | `Profile-{flavor}`, `flutter --profile` |
| beta | `src/{flavor}Beta/` | `{flavor}BetaAppIcon` | `Beta-{flavor}`, xcodebuild / Gradle `assemble{Flavor}Beta` |

**Profile is not beta.** Store builds use **`--release`** only. Beta on iOS/macOS uses **`Beta-{flavor}`** via `xcodebuild` (Flutter has no `--beta` CLI mode).

## IDs

- Flavor **`applicationID`** → Android `applicationId`; default **ios/macos** `bundleId` when platform blocks omitted.
- Use **`ios.applicationID`** / **`macos.applicationID`** in YAML (not `bundleId`); parser maps in `darwin_json.dart`.

## Platform gating

One `icon:` block per flavor. Processors run only for platforms in that flavor’s **`platforms`** list (`androidFlavors` / `iosFlavors` / `macosFlavors` on `Flavourist`).

| Instruction | Output |
|-------------|--------|
| `android:icons` | Adaptive drawables + legacy mipmaps per variant source set |
| `ios:icons` | `ios/Runner/Assets.xcassets/<prefix>AppIcon.appiconset/` |
| `macos:icons` | `macos/Runner/Assets.xcassets/<prefix>AppIcon.appiconset/` |

## Asset roles

- **`foreground` / `background`**: Android adaptive layers — not the Darwin launcher master alone.
- **`overlay`**: PNG composited on composed flat icons and adaptive foreground (`icon_compose.dart`).
- **Darwin legacy `AppIcon`**: composed square via `icon_compose.dart` unless `ios.icon` / `macos.icon` override.
- **`ASSET_PREFIX`** in xcconfig: `{flavor}`, `{flavor}Debug`, `{flavor}Profile`, `{flavor}Beta` when variant `icon:` is configured.

## Implementation

- Resolve paths in **`IconResolver`** (`lib/src/utils/icon_resolver.dart`); variants via **`IconVariant`** (`lib/src/utils/icon_variant.dart`).
- Adaptive Android XML: `AndroidGenerateIclauncherXmlProcessor` adds `<monochrome>` only when `icon.monochrome` is set.
- After parser/model changes: `dart run build_runner build` in flavourist; consumers run `dart run flavourist`.
- Wiki-app builds: **`scripts/build.sh`** supports `--release`, `--debug`, `--profile`, `--beta`.
- Do not remove `android:buildGradle` magic comments.

## Out of scope

Store listing icons, splash screens (separate future work).
